Item: GenericEnum
Kind: Enum
Visibility: Public
Defined at: fixture_crate::GenericEnum

A generic enum for testing

See also [`crate::TestEnum`]


```rust
enum GenericEnum<T, U = String>
where
    T: Clone + Send,
    U: std::fmt::Display {
    /// Simple variant
    Simple,
    /// Variant with generic data
    WithData(T),
    /// Variant with mixed generics
    Mixed {
        data: T,
        info: U,
    },
}
```

